About

    This directory contains a number of patches, organised
    in subdirectories with names identical to the directories
    where the original source files are located.

    The idea is to preserve ramses' package structure to
    facilitate updating my patches whenever the code gets
    updated, and conversely, to suggest changes to the main code
    (and request the corresponding git pulls).

    For more information see each subdirectory's README.

    Note that other patches may exist within this directory,
    e.g. oagertz.
